      "redistributed": false,
      "note": "Section 3 defines how href attributes reference MIME parts. The quotes below are checked against a copy matching this digest by \"test_attachment_sources.py --verify-swa-note <copy>\".",
      "quotes": [
        "referenced by a URI given as the value of an href attribute",
        "this process does not apply to same-document references as defined in section 4.2 of RFC 2396",
        "the mechanism for explicit specification of a base URI within a SOAP 1.1 message will be the XML base mechanism",
        "the URI from the closest such Content-Location header is the base URI for the entity",
        "Default Base URI: the default base URI will be",
        "thismessage:/",
        "If a Content-Location header is present with an absolute URI value then that URI is a label for the part",
        "If a Content-ID header is present, then an absolute URI label for the part is formed using the CID URI scheme",
        "If no match is found, use normal resolution rules based on the URI scheme"
      ]
    },
